  "description": "Backend service implementing the FDC3 Desktop Agent standard for ComposeUI. \n\t\t\tHandles requests from FDC3 client libraries, enabling applications to interoperate using FDC3 context, intents, and channels. \n\t\t\tProvides APIs for app discovery, context sharing, and intent resolution, with integration for FDC3 App Directory and support for dependency injection.\n\t\t\tCompatible with .NET Standard 2.0.\n\t\t\tMore Details: https://morganstanley.github.io/ComposeUI/",
